","/arc-plc/montana/wibaux-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids in Wibaux County came in under 90% of normal in September to October and in October to November in 40 of 75 years since 1951. In 2026 so far, the middle sat at 38% of normal in January to February and 41% in April to May. In 2025, October to November ran 235% of normal on the middle. The driest year on every grid was 1988, with grid 32504 at 46%.</p>"}
